# The `[vibe-test]` summary from a results file ($1; one record per file that
# ran) plus $2 failures that recorded no verdict (a dispatcher that refused a
# whole batch). The test total is printed only when every count is exact; a
# raw-occurrence count (no python3, a stripped name section) or an unrecorded
# failure would present an over-count as a total, so the summary stays
# files-only there. Returns non-zero when anything failed.
host_test_summary() {
